<title>ZIMBABWE: CRICKET-DISTRICTS XI V ENGLAND ONE-DAY MATCH ABANDONED - RAIN.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-DISTRICTS XI V ENGLAND ONE-DAY MATCH ABANDONED - RAIN.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1996-11-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The one-day cricket between a Zimbabwe Districts XI and England was abandoned on Saturday because of heavy rain.</p>
<p>Scores: Districts XI 198-9 in 45.3 overs.</p>
